  "metadata": {
    "alignment": "standard",
    "description": "r0b0tlab's SM121 vLLM overlay serving the official nvidia/GLM-5.3-Flash-NVFP4 ModelOpt checkpoint (MIT) with the incoai DFlash2 K7 block-diffusion drafter (CC-BY-NC-ND-4.0, non-commercial, no derivatives). TP2 over two Sparks, 126,720-token window, bf16 KV, FULL_DECODE_ONLY CUDA graphs, thinking at reasoning_effort max, image and video input. Same checkpoint is used by tonyd2wild abb38bb0 and sfxnz 072c3f68; this recipe follows r0b0tlab 22269731. Performance figures are upstream claims until measured here; Vonk physical two-Spark acceptance is pending.",
